      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Kukhnya Season 2, Episode 11. At the shared apartment, tensions flare between Nastya and Sasha as Sasha rearranges the kitchen and poisons the cockroaches without asking, causing Nastya to worry that the poison has made Pashka the turtle sluggish.",
